      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#5→0 · A19/A21 comparisons; Neumann and Gebser qualified; the human-amplified ledger",
          "title": "The age becomes visible as an age",
          "italic": "The whole returns-to the project as historical de-monopolisation: contrary images and transforming practices expose the history within a seemingly immediate background — and the person must still judge and act.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "The existing project operation is historical de-monopolisation: an age inherits a governing image; the image becomes an apparently immediate background of judgment; its exclusions remain active; contrary images and transforming practices expose the history within that background. An age can then become visible as an age, and its inherited measure revisable. The whole compares A19's complex as local arbitration regime while keeping the substrates distinct — a complex, a theological image, a Protected Account and a civilisation's symbolic frame carry different evidential burdens. A21 receives the difference between returning unchanged and returning able to receive what had only been",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "projected. Neumann supplies the shared ground without becoming evidence for the historical details; Gebser's non-chronological Origin stays distinct from Jung's aeonic history. The success/succession seam keeps generative and historical succession alive — alchemy's forgotten motherhood articulating the latter. Q27's register decision places Christ/Antichrist at the occupied slash after the native derivation; Antichrist naming and Aquarian eschatology belong to the plate register, not public historical proof. The exact symbolic appointments to QL remain human-amplified: no; the whole-before-fragments commitment stands as design law, and every later index must return to this complete whole.\n\nOccurrences: the governing image's background operation (#1–#4, #5→0); the Shadow Quaternio's declared modernity (#4, #5→0); the sixteen recovered passage locations as the house's standing (#5→0).",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
